{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "70eb6ba0894e0dd112b8d70989218817dd42eb5223dba3a46f054de390513b42", "ja": "＜テキスト非表示＞", "zh": "＜不显示文本＞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1001_null", "source_sha256": "a984b40130bcd9f26aa8b5cf42e64a5bdd8c69138f0cf1143be3a0f844571af2", "ja": "■「ここまでのあらすじ」画面内表示■", "zh": "■“前情提要”画面内显示■", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "2083efb063247821cbc9679512416c81abcfbcf0ed60e91f64b1d61422f99435", "ja": "Team3rdの写真集が発売された数日後……", "zh": "Team3rd的写真集发售后过了几天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "813a9c2ea582510646c8a9f161b52cc308e8271c6af458f4ee528cb3c15d96eb", "ja": "というわけで！　ついに私たち、Team3rdの\nデビュー写真集が発売されてしまったわけですが……。", "zh": "也就是说！我们的Team3rd出道写真集终于发售了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "1ac709a092ed57dba7469122210b00fe4afdcc08db94b3d8c87a4f70924ef731", "ja": "ちなみにみなさんは、周りの反応とか、\n自分の変化とか、あったりしました……？", "zh": "顺便问一下，大家有没有感受到周围人的反应，或者自己发生了什么变化……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "7d246791470bd4fc878c2407a3a171dd0e68943d8f4bd5072e11d06971bc0fc5", "ja": "いっぱいあったぞ！\nえっと、ばあちゃんと、お父さんとお母さんと～。", "zh": "有好多好多哦！\n那个，奶奶、爸爸还有妈妈～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "2bd3b80165d6e01054649fb5c7ef7c6e6479eae22a72ad38aff44c9caa8109f1", "ja": "あと学校の友だちと、育とももこにも、\nたくさん「すごーい！」って言われたんだ！　くふふ♪", "zh": "还有学校里的朋友，还有育和桃子，也都对我说了好多次“好厉害——”！咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "97dad54291ef8fb45f54982638bc28eb6a115bbcdf56a9e7bf12045dd9ca4084", "ja": "よかったね、環ちゃん。……私は、まだ恥ずかしくて\n周りに見せてないから、反応はよくわからないけど……", "zh": "太好了，环。……我还觉得不好意思，所以还没给身边的人看过，也不太清楚大家会有什么反应，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e4cb89bfbd0ff3b786c7dc52140036d002fc28be626796f10eb381dabf0034c9", "ja": "ネットを見てるとたまに宣伝が出てきて、\n1人でドキドキするようになっちゃった……。", "zh": "上网时偶尔会跳出宣传广告，现在看到1个人就会紧张得心怦怦跳了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "bbc478f7f0417884daa81da50be3b79b5e38010d73e3914c13d915f61851e794", "ja": "わかります！　私も、いきつけの本屋さんに入荷\nしていることに気づいて、思わず逃げ出しました！", "zh": "我懂！我也是发现常去的书店进货后，忍不住逃了出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "b8692ae53d357426d098a30992c70328cf498895b6033f9a45741469efc7021a", "ja": "はぁ。まさか私の足が、\n本屋さんから遠ざかる日が来ようとは……。", "zh": "唉。没想到有一天，我的脚竟然会远离书店……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "18e9f4319a7f72ebbce898dc97fb8ffa317b71dfeae0c59ce8ae5c5378668b1f", "ja": "私も、まだちょっと恥ずかしいかな。外を歩くとき、\n人の目が気になるようにもなったし……。", "zh": "我也还是觉得有点害羞。走在外面的时候，也开始在意起别人的目光了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "ab5147b30eeac397bbf01886bc717eb4778562dd4f8158e1fc7871c3838d566f", "ja": "まだ誰にも知られてないのに、万が一に備えて、\n身だしなみはきちんとするようになったと思う。", "zh": "明明根本就没人认识我，但为了以防万一，\n我觉得自己也开始注重起仪表来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "ca1404b282828c8bc1baca3e16d5f68fbee813d3d661d69dc28221d4cc5baa94", "ja": "にゃはは♪　琴葉は前からちゃんとしてるじゃん！\nそれ以上きちんとしたら、アタシとの落差ヤバくない？", "zh": "呀哈哈♪琴叶从以前开始就一直很规矩嘛！\n要是再规矩下去，和我的差距岂不是要大得离谱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "0feca35eaaffbfb825b57ab050ef1a7ae79524bb1fb6a167ab7de1253d5673e2", "ja": "恵美は自然にしててもオシャレだから……。\nあ、何かコツとか、気を付けてることとかある？", "zh": "因为惠美就算保持自然也很时髦……  \n啊，有没有什么诀窍，或者平时会注意些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "1de375ddc68e45c4bdbc8a727b03db54e9953b17d039127281b71afb8433d343", "ja": "え？　いや特にないけど。……アレかな、\nメイクとかのせいかな？　ちょっと今いじってみる？", "zh": "诶？倒也没什么特别的……或许是化妆之类的原因吧？要不要现在稍微试着调整一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8156f4595bbd369db5b2566fa01ddac65473bb63dce517a14a966bf59aeda1f9", "ja": "ふふっ、私も教わりたいなぁ♪\nでもこれからミーティングだから、その後でね？", "zh": "呵呵，我也想学学呢♪\n不过接下来要开会，所以等结束后再教我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "9ed827b7df8671ae1433549c666a2459c799185678bc5c1050ea4f851d375d17", "ja": "おやぶん、お仕事のお話するって言ってたよね！\nたまき、ずっと楽しみにしてたんだ～。……あ、来た！", "zh": "老大，你之前说过要聊工作的事吧！\n环一直期待着呢～……啊，来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1018_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "0c983baf59094b85046a9e419cd76cdc0e1b6c21980367c5e0849fa10e8bfce0", "ja": "おっ、Team3rd、全員集まってるな。\nみんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "哦，Team3rd，大家都到齐了啊。  \n大家，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "fcfcc876cb8f085523b6979218a5078715c1f3130e1425e024a4bc9dcf65d056", "ja": "お疲れさま～！", "zh": "辛苦啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "b6f4b1216555f300c2ea6f23bfe9229c4f5c832846b6865816ab9821cd23b5ad", "ja": "お疲れさまです！", "zh": "辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "b6f4b1216555f300c2ea6f23bfe9229c4f5c832846b6865816ab9821cd23b5ad", "ja": "お疲れさまです！", "zh": "辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "25f60c34dbce83f7e25218e1205e41406f4099c665790ffa7086f0428cc17972", "ja": "お疲れさま♪", "zh": "辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c68a87292b3f5443bce3ec9942110b425ba29d38763cb2dcd7a542d72faa939e", "ja": "お疲れさまです♪", "zh": "辛苦你了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "8b5a3adc390ed41cdf1f4527e7c8b3f8064e02e9fc684712474c8046fb09998a", "ja": "もう知ってると思うけど、みんなの写真集、\nかなりの評判だぞ。口コミもじわじわ広がってる！", "zh": "想必你们也已经知道了，大家的写真集\n反响相当不错哦。口碑也渐渐传开了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "c967347b1656b87bd8efc769c1d3554a37e89c69ce52a81bee0713526a0c5a19", "ja": "みんな本当によく頑張ってくれた。……というわけで、\n今日はカメラマンの早坂さんにも来てもらったんだ。", "zh": "大家真的都很努力。……所以，\n今天我也请摄影师早坂小姐过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1027_403sor", "source_sha256": "2be353662150e11cba2249c3dc901c40effb0386ade3ddaeba1b0dc664503bca", "ja": "どうも、カメラマンの早坂そらです！\nTeam3rdのみなさん、その節はお世話になりました！", "zh": "大家好，我是摄影师早坂空！  \nTeam3rd的各位，那次承蒙大家关照了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1028_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ce7a4e52559d1af29db9d57ae954dbfda363e7d8001078e4c375ebfbe5fc093f", "ja": "こちらこそ、本当にお世話になりました。写真集の評判\nも、カメラマンさんが綺麗に撮ってくれたおかげです♪", "zh": "我才要感谢您，真的承蒙照顾了。写真集的反响这么好，也多亏摄影师把照片拍得这么漂亮♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1029_403sor", "source_sha256": "e47363cbf9334407e53b31eba6c0ff5917503cd474704464783e9cfe0908d287", "ja": "とんでもない、被写体の魅力の勝利ですよ。\n風花さんの写真も、すこぶる大人気です！", "zh": "哪里的话，这是被拍摄对象的魅力带来的胜利。  \n风花小姐的照片也大受欢迎！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fa1f1ee12161bc4578430c7ccecdfaf4e033ea8d8357f9623a4f44b8eb9af862", "ja": "す、すこぶる……！", "zh": "非、非常受欢迎……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "59078af79fbec369d21ee64a66f6bed2f3f650f3db170beccb7565e8d07c3ee3", "ja": "その写真集がきっかけになって、いい話が来てるんだ。\n深夜の歌番組からオファーが届いた！", "zh": "就是因为那本写真集，有个不错的机会找上门来了。深夜歌唱节目的邀约送到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "d37688f62fa4e269bf3400599b7382418dfadf9342116300aa7d5511e8e445f6", "ja": "！　深夜の歌番組って、テレビですか！？", "zh": "！　深夜歌唱节目，是电视节目吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1033_401pro", "source_sha256": "ec50020a9214f9b022b6f5d09711f76e455a051bec94df83fed2ee6115d51423", "ja": "みんなも知ってるんじゃないかな。15分のミニ番組だ\nけど、毎回アーティストのトークが面白くて人気の……", "zh": "大家应该也知道吧。虽说只是15分钟的短节目，\n不过每次参演艺人的谈话都很有意思，挺受欢迎的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "f5f7250386bd1e8c72865bfb5f43eece4831bd495eec1e6059b5ba797fc78b7f", "ja": "え、もしかしてゴマダンゴさんの番組！？\nうそ、マジで！？　地味に超いい話じゃん！", "zh": "诶，难道是芝麻团先生的节目！？  \n不会吧，真的假的！？这消息也太棒了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1035_041fuk", "source_sha256": "73855921868f3a525ab58cf71203985660f17e946a7f786bd8b95b45cea23757", "ja": "私もたまに見てます！　たしか、あの番組に出てから\n口コミで人気が広がった人もたくさんいるって……！", "zh": "我偶尔也会看！我记得，有很多人上过那个节目后，靠口碑人气越来越高……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "6059f886c6ac89dbdf2f6d74bc0a01c30a431325906dcf298d8ede91e455d257", "ja": "そういえば、学校の友達がよく話しているような……。\nわ、私たちで、大丈夫ですか！？", "zh": "说起来，学校里的朋友好像经常会聊到……。我、我们真的没问题吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1037_401pro", "source_sha256": "bf307c7d5f9b035c02232c211336cca4e0326da0c5d4e4940813c7d7ee9d1ca2", "ja": "もちろん。写真集の初動が好調だからこその打診だ。\nこの勢いには、どんどん乗っていきたいと思ってる。", "zh": "当然没问题。正因为写真集首发销量喜人，对方才会找上门来。\n我觉得应该顺着这股势头，乘胜追击才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1038_403sor", "source_sha256": "a42ec07c45b49c3cef4f4b4653468394f0d5487165783333cfbe28f47da860d0", "ja": "もう一段階大きく売り出すにも、うってつけの\nタイミングですよね。今が増刷のかけ時です！", "zh": "要再更进一步扩大宣传规模，现在正是绝佳时机。该加印写真集了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1039_401pro", "source_sha256": "70ee7ffcef37957891989ef40e8e07593d662743c887fa4d0d112519c80762c1", "ja": "はい！　というわけで、今回早坂さんには番組収録風景\nを撮ってもらって、写真集の販促に使うつもりだ。", "zh": "对！所以这次，我打算请早坂小姐拍摄节目录制现场，用来宣传写真集。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1040_401pro", "source_sha256": "1068c7744e897df8969ac0aeee491f60c5288c54fa9cf42d0701789bc5ed44a6", "ja": "それから、普段番組を見て、\n知ってるメンバーもいると思うけど……。", "zh": "而且，平时看节目时，应该也有认识的成员吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1041_401pro", "source_sha256": "e1e6e2b405de9adf17bd93acc066d11461e2a5e0e6e694aeb7b6cd08929ecf51", "ja": "出演アーティストは歌も披露させてもらえるからな。\nみんなのデビュー曲、いよいよテレビでお披露目だ！", "zh": "出演的偶像还能在节目中献唱呢。大家的出道曲，终于要在电视上首次亮相了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1042_040tam", "source_sha256": "ef07dc19211f33682fc72d7c95b90bb74e6f10fc7fb16355c0c5618bb17c536a", "ja": "！　デビュー曲のお披露目……。\nたまきたち、テレビで歌えるの？", "zh": "！出道曲的首次亮相……\n我们能在电视上唱歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1043_040tam", "source_sha256": "1b5de90bf280287080fd391d3667e31e10d0662c056ebcab7afaaf06db31e698", "ja": "ばあちゃんにステージ見てもらえるんだ！？\nわーい！　たまき、すっごくうれしいぞ！！", "zh": "奶奶能看到我的舞台了！？  \n好耶！环超级开心的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1044_041fuk", "source_sha256": "19f84b9ca2f10fc2b95c806228b50f0290c2e821568467679e7784232540c998", "ja": "環ちゃん……うん、そうだよね。\n私たちのステージ、大事な人みんなに見てもらおうね！", "zh": "小环……嗯，确实是这样呢。\n让重要的人们都来看看我们的舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1045_017kth", "source_sha256": "0cafbd2c2cab8d44159490c621e534828b8f98527dd37f80b4d45f42c45f2e89", "ja": "環ちゃんのお婆さんは香川でしたよね。\nプロデューサー、放送、大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "环的奶奶是在香川吧。  \n制作人，播出没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1046_401pro", "source_sha256": "612f5c55b8f1e454e05cc169b1e51fc22372cccf83126f05269c58e7906a2ccb", "ja": "ああ、えっと……\nうん、系列局もあるから大丈夫！", "zh": "啊，那个……\n嗯，因为还有关联电视台，所以没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1047_020meg", "source_sha256": "3f4fd2952544b0baa1e3963f444571440914488fd66dad015bdbe515a86cc087", "ja": "よかった～♪　……アタシ達もさ、見て欲しい人\nいっぱいいるし。絶対最高のステージにしなくちゃ！", "zh": "太好了～♪……我们这边也有很多想让大家看到的人。所以一定要把它变成最棒的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1048_026yur", "source_sha256": "0883e1644fde471313ac3eb43a3cae5077c1ddbe0ab72a3f0d1b0c47483d0136", "ja": "は、はい！　クラスの子に「夜中に出てた！？」って\n問い詰められても、胸を張れるよう……頑張ります！", "zh": "是、是！就算被班里的同学追问“你半夜出门了！？”也能挺起胸膛……我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1049_017kth", "source_sha256": "554545da2c8a9b077bc9b8dbfa2e9f4e6a4eed32a9f7cecb7551193376c393f4", "ja": "Team3rd全員で、しっかりと準備を進めます！", "zh": "Team3rd的全员会一起好好做好准备的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_intro_1050_401pro", "source_sha256": "14b0e40cb524e9ca655252cf55051e8c6d369150c8b1e82175a8176195c2cf88", "ja": "うん。最高のデビューイベント、最高の写真集、\nそして最高のデビューステージになるよう、頑張ろう！", "zh": "嗯。为了打造最棒的出道活动、最棒的写真集，还有最棒的出道舞台，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
